<title>DUBAI: Saudi airlines to resume Beirut flights.</title>
<headline>Saudi airlines to resume Beirut flights.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabian Airlines Corp will resume flights to Beirut next week after a 15-year halt because of the Lebanese civil war, the official Saudi news agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>The four-weekly flights will start on February 1, it added.</p>
<p>Tens of thousands of Lebanese work in Saudi Arabia and many Saudis travel to Beirut for vacation every year -- especially during summer to escape soaring desert heat.</p>
</text>
